#: lliurex-guard/python3-lliurexguard/rsrc/GuardManager.qml:242
msgid ""
"Do yo want to change to black list mode?\n"
"If you activate this mode, you will not be able to access the urls contained "
"in the active lists"
msgstr ""
"Voleu canviar al mode de llista negra?\n"
"Si activeu aquest mode, no podreu accedir als url que estiguen en les "
"llistes actives"

